# Install

## NPM
Download the installer at https://nodejs.org/en/download/
Alternatively, consider using nvm (Node Version Manager).

## Firebase
https://firebase.google.com/docs/cli


# Starting the emulator
firebase emulators:start --import ./exported-data4 --only functions,hosting,firestore

## View sites
http://localhost:5000
http://localhost:5000/pds
http://localhost:5000/mira
http://localhost:5000/banaux


# Important links for managing the published web site

https://console.cloud.google.com/run?project=aura-persona
https://console.cloud.google.com/logs